{"2905380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Smashist", "steam_appid": 2905380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/1d20ef626d6e851712bcaf11f9295d11.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Smashist is a first-person brawler set in a 1950's tavern with an army of fascist soldiers at the door. </strong>It puts you in the shoes of a strong-fisted revolutionary who's out to topple the regime, one punch to the snout at at time. With over-the-top silly physics and a wide selection of booze, you need to keep the regime soldiers occupied while your revolutionary friends free the city outside. Grab, throw, smash and drink your way to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.mp4?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free the people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've lured the fascist soldiers here, now keep them occupied while your revolutionary friends free the city outside the pub. The further you go, the more of the regime gets toppled, the angrier the pigs get. If you manage to defeat all the lieutenants and their lackeys, your friends on the outside might just have a chance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.mp4?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock drinks that give new abilities and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly fascist smashing physics - send your enemies flying</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create different builds for each run to go further! Choose your drinks and use the abilities to beat down more fascist pigs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types - hounds, brawlers, bombers, shooters to name a few</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple boss fights. Punch their army to a pulp and the lieutenants will have to show up to deal with you themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about resistance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/d590519bf2f5fbc8ec0529b2152fac2e.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/d590519bf2f5fbc8ec0529b2152fac2e.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/d590519bf2f5fbc8ec0529b2152fac2e.mp4?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/1d20ef626d6e851712bcaf11f9295d11.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Smashist is a first-person brawler set in a 1950's tavern with an army of fascist soldiers at the door. </strong>It puts you in the shoes of a strong-fisted revolutionary who's out to topple the regime, one punch to the snout at at time. With over-the-top silly physics and a wide selection of booze, you need to keep the regime soldiers occupied while your revolutionary friends free the city outside. Grab, throw, smash and drink your way to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/9b720c59ebb31805b4d47b63d327fc85.mp4?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free the people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've lured the fascist soldiers here, now keep them occupied while your revolutionary friends free the city outside the pub. The further you go, the more of the regime gets toppled, the angrier the pigs get. If you manage to defeat all the lieutenants and their lackeys, your friends on the outside might just have a chance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/6087600aae344d1d8450bd092143b3f1.mp4?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock drinks that give new abilities and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly fascist smashing physics - send your enemies flying</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create different builds for each run to go further! Choose your drinks and use the abilities to beat down more fascist pigs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types - hounds, brawlers, bombers, shooters to name a few</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple boss fights. Punch their army to a pulp and the lieutenants will have to show up to deal with you themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about resistance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/d590519bf2f5fbc8ec0529b2152fac2e.poster.avif?t=1777010782\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905380/extras/d590519bf2f5fbc8ec0529b2152fac2e.webm?t=1777010782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste